==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''45 Million Downloads'''}} for The Battle Cats!<br>
Celebrate another milestone with the Cat Army, with special events and more!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Login between August 19th (11:00am) and September 2nd (11:00am) to check out the fun!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Monthly All-Star Stages!'''}}<br>
Insane-difficulty Monthly All-Star Stages bring back all of the toughest bosses from the limited-edition Monthly Stages!

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Special Celebration'''}}<br>
August 19th (11am) thru August 22nd (11am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Ultra Celebration'''}}<br>
August 22th (11am) thru August 24th (11am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Miracle Celebration'''}}<br>
August 24th (11am) thru August 26th (11am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Wonderful Celebration'''}}<br>
August 26th (11am) thru August 28th (11am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Excellent Celebration'''}}<br>
August 28th (11am) thru August 30th (11am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Event All-Stars: Grand Jubilee!'''}}<br>
August 30th (11am) thru Septmber 2nd (11am)

Clear these stages for a chance to collect tons of XP!<br>
<small><small>※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Celebrate 45 Million Installs with "Cybear's Vengeance"'''}}<br>
Your chance to collect a pile of Cat Tickets! The Deadly challenge "Cybear's Vengeance" is here for a limited time!<br>
Clear the stage any you might pick up a stack of {{Color|#FF0000|'''5 Cat Tickets!'''}}<br>
Plus, the first time you clear the stage, you can collect a reward of {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''30 Cat Food!'''}}<br>
<small><small>※ If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Super Challenging Limited Special Stages appear in one big event!'''}}<br>
Can you topple the biggest bosses of the Special Stages?<br>
Irregularly appearing Limited Special stages are coming one after the other!<br>
Check the schedule below!

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Clionel Ascendant'''}}<br>
August 19th (11:00am) thru 21st (10:59am)<br>
August 26th (11:00am) thru 27th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Queen's Coronation'''}}<br>
August 21st (11:00am) thru 22nd (10:59am)<br>
August 27th (11:00am) thru 28th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・River Styx'''}}<br>
August 22nd (11:00am) thru 23rd (10:59am)<br>
August 28th (11:00am) thru 29th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Dead on Debut'''}}<br>
August 23rd (11:00am) thru 29th (10:59am)<br>
August 29th (11:00am) thru 30th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・King Wahwah's Revenge'''}}<br>
August 24th (11:00am) thru 25th (10:59am)<br>
August 30th (11:00am) thru 31st (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Deeply Dreaming'''}}<br>
August 25th (11:00am) thru 26th (10:59am)<br>
August 31st (11:00am) thru September 2nd (10:59am)

Can you withstand the gauntlet of giants?! Clear the stages and earn limited Cat Unit rewards!<br>
Plus, get extra rewards by clearing Special Missions in the Catnip Challenges!<br>
<small><small>※ All Mission Rewards must be claimed at the Catnip Challenges before this event ends on September 2nd (10:59).</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''XP Harvest'''}} for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes and XP as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Cats Eye Cave'''}}: August 19th (11am) thru 26th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・XP Harvest'''}}: August 26th (11am) thru September 2nd (10:59am)

Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Limited Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Catfruit Capsules'''}}<br>
August 19th (11:00am) through August 26th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Catseye Capsules'''}}<br>
August 26th (11:00am) through September 2nd (2:59pm)

<small><small>※The Catfruit Limited Capsules provide Catfruit and XP rewards, while Catseye Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes and XP!<br>
※Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed in The Battle Cats, and Catseye Limited Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules once User Rank 1600 is cleared.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Treasure Festival, On Now!'''}}<br>
During this event, get {{Color|#FF6600|'''increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Treasure Festival'''}}, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#008000|'''even days (8/20, 8/22, 8/24, 8/26, 8/28, 8/30, 9/2)'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''odd days (8/19, 8/21, 8/23, 8/25, 8/27, 8/29, 8/31, 9/1)'''}} head to {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#335599|'''8/21, 8/24, 8/27, 8/30 and 9/2!'''}}<br>
<small><small>※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign! Check in and profit!

